       "title": "Hyatt Centric Downtown Denver",
       "titleTag": "h1",
       "titleClass": "h2 display",
       "lede": "If you’re planning an event at Hyatt Centric Downtown Denver, you’ve probably seen the rooftop already. It’s an awesome indoor-outdoor bar on the top floor, looking out over the buildings downtown, and live music sounds great up there.",
       "headingText": [
        {
         "html": "<a href=\"/artists/tejas-singh/\">Tejas Singh</a> played the rooftop bar and patio as a duo for a corporate conference reception hosted by Softdocs."
